To discuss a new integration or Centrapay support on a new device, contact us at
[integrations@centrapay.com](mailto:integrations@centrapay.com).

## Terminal Integrations

Centrapay is integrated with a wide range of payment terminals. If your device is not listed below, it may not be supported.

### Eftpos Central Group

